s://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nSome usability comments:\r\n\r\n- The hue slider should go faster when you adjust it with the keyboard arrows or gamepad buttons. Compare its speed to the color value on the left:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fca1da03-3bab-499d-8ede-584f23a9d7cd\r\n\r\nIdeally, the speed at which the hue is adjusted should match the color value on the left, which is probably 3× to 4× faster. This can be done by increasing the increment for each button press on the hue slider.\r\n\r\n- When using a color picker with a wheel shape, moving upwards should \"slide\" along the circle when you've reached the top (same for any other edge):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f85f6c6f-f3e1-4b13-af6c-29bc2adc3b1d\r\n\r\nRight now, it stops so you need to manually move to the left then move back up again.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99374#pullrequestreview-2459354223","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99374","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-11-25T18:39:09Z"},{"id":2459355169,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Slsgh","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"3abc8f88c67105d535c43a819e4c28e1eb6d10a1","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://